  "text": "## PART 1: SmartSaver Account  \n### Product Overview  \n**What It Is:**\nA fully accessible savings account with variable interest rates tied to the Bank of England base rate.  \n**Who It's For:**\n- Customers who want to save money\n- Anyone looking for competitive interest rates\n- People who may need to access their money quickly\n- Both individuals and joint account holders  \n**Key Benefit:**\nEarn competitive interest (4.50%–4.80% AER) while maintaining full access to your money.",
